	(descr "Akizuki AE-TPS63802 buck-boost module 20x13mm on its 4-pin 2.54mm header CN1 (1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 VOUT, 4 EN) plus one plain dummy pin for support. The module floats about 2.5mm above the board, so low parts may sit under it. Courtyard = the two pin strips only; the module outline is on F.SilkS/F.Fab.")
